OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested after gun fired in
OL,4,Astreet
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested after
OL,7,Freports of a gun being fired on a
OL,8,Fresidential street in Doncaster.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Gordon Road in
OL,11,FEdlington at about 22:15 BST on Friday
OL,12,Fand evidence consistent with a firearms
OL,13,Fdischarge was found, according to South
OL,14,FYorkshire Police.
OL,16,FThe men, aged 37 and 27, were arrested
OL,17,Fon suspicion of possession of firearms
OL,18,Fwith intent and both remain in custody.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
