OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested after gun fired in
OL,4,Astreet
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo one was injured during the incident
OL,7,Fand a cordon remained in place on
OL,8,FMonday, with officers working "at pace"
OL,9,Fto investigate the incident, a force
OL,10,Fspokesperson said.
